		{
			"id":"094619fdad86f0f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"some entities that have these mechanics:\n\n- search for and eat food\n- search for prey and kill\n- drill through terrain\n- make babies\n- throw destructive fireball\n- create new terrain\n- change the floor",
			"styleAttributes":{},
